hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"999","Bundar told us, Yahya told us, meaning Ibn Sa’id, Yazid bin Kaysan told us, Abu Hazim told me, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, he said: Our wedding With the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, and we did not wake up until the sun had risen. Then the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Let every person take At the head of his mount, for this is a place where Satan came to us.” So we did so, so he called for water, performed ablution, then prayed two prostrations, then the Iqama was performed. Prayer, and he prayed the morning prayer. Abu Bakr said: And in the news of Abdul Rahman bin Abdullah, on the authority of his father, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said: “He prayed two rak’ahs, then He prayed Fajr, and likewise according to the report of Al-Hasan, on the authority of Imran bin Husayn"
